{"id":"13847817d539efaf","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-ap-equals-pspace.md","title":"thm-ap-equals-pspace (AP = PSPACE)","display":"thm-ap-equals-pspace (AP = PSPACE)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-ap]]","[[28-df-atm]]","[[28-df-pspace]]","[[28-df-tqbf]]","[[28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete]]"],"display":"thm-ap-equals-pspace (AP = PSPACE)","label":"28-thm-ap-equals-pspace","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-ap-equals-pspace","AP = PSPACE","Alternating polynomial time equals polynomial space"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4070b2f37a2197f6\" href=\"?note=4070b2f37a2197f6\" title=\"28-df-ap\">28-df-ap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9efd20f439611336\" href=\"?note=9efd20f439611336\" title=\"28-df-atm\">28-df-atm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e3545f8c2a4ed307\" href=\"?note=e3545f8c2a4ed307\" title=\"28-df-tqbf\">28-df-tqbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed20d679e3199320\" href=\"?note=ed20d679e3199320\" title=\"28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete\">28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ap-equals-pspace (AP = PSPACE)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-ap-equals-pspace"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-ap-equals-pspace</span><span>AP = PSPACE</span><span>Alternating polynomial time equals polynomial space</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{AP}\">\\(\\mathbf{AP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TQBF}\\)</span> 使用本目录定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{AP}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{AP}=\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：本次复核两个包含方向的结构；反向使用 TQBF 完全性，其一般配置编码证明未在本条完整重建。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>AP 机的每条分支只有多项式长度，因此确定型深度优先求接受树时，每层保存一个多项式大小配置，仍只需多项式空间。反向利用 TQBF 的 PSPACE 完全性：先在多项式时间内产生对应公式，再按量词类型作存在或全称选择，最后确定求矩阵值；每条分支在多项式时间内结束。该路线正是原书证明梗概，避免旧稿未定义的 AReach 和端点选择符号。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理5.10及证明梗概；印刷100页；PDF126页。两个包含方向的证明结构已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ap","status":"resolved","id":"4070b2f37a2197f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ap]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-atm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tqbf","status":"resolved","id":"e3545f8c2a4ed307","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tqbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete","status":